    "Dada la ecuacion:\n",
    "$$\n",
    "v_0 - 2D_{JK}(J+1)K^2\n",
    "$$\n",
    "y dado que la transicion rotacional del Isotiocianato de Silano es $J = 8 \\leftarrow 7$.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\Rightarrow v_0 - 16D_{JK}K^2\n",
    "$$\n",
    "Dada la ecuacion lineal que obtuvimos anteriormente cuando $ K = 7 $\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\Rightarrow D_{JK} = \\frac{m}{16}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "o la pendiente obtenida entre 16\n"
   ]
